Title: Amiga Demo Reel
Credit: A Cine Toaster demo production

INT. WORKBENCH ATRIUM - BLACK

A white cursor blinks in silence. Color bars unfold into a vast geometric hall.

NOVA, a pilot made from crisp pixels and reflected light, steps through the
newly drawn doorway.

NOVA
Let's wake the rest of it.

EXT. COPPER SKY - CONTINUOUS

Horizontal bands roll across a violet horizon. Nova rides a chrome disk between
layers of clouds moving at impossible speeds.

EXT. PIXEL CAUSEWAY - DAY

The disk fractures into a staircase of color. Each footstep restores another
piece of the landscape.

INT. TOASTER STAGE - NIGHT

Monitors, cameras, and luminous switches rise from darkness. Nova presses the
final key. Every screen shows a different world, perfectly synchronized.

EXT. GRID OCEAN - SUNRISE

The worlds fold into a single emblem above the water. Nova turns toward camera
as the machine signs off with one last burst of color.
